{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國數字相框製造商Aura推出了新一代Ink電子墨水相框，新產品將屏幕尺寸從上一代的13英寸縮小至10英寸，同時改進了彩色顯示技術，並將售價從499美元降低至349美元。Aura希望通過這款產品，讓電子相框在外觀上更加接近傳統紙質照片，使其能夠自然融入家庭裝飾，而不是顯得像一塊擺放在牆上的電子屏幕。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585828.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.760927+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:52:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"33c581fb715b8204cf10041f7e030f12dd13162fbe6979f0e557e44db4794ec6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}